---
const phone = '6722671419';
const phoneLabel = '672 267 1419';
---

<section class="next-step" id="contacto">
  <p class="eyebrow">Tu siguiente paso</p>
  <h2>Haz que tu casa esté<br /><span>segura y conectada 24/7.</span></h2>
  <p>Cuéntanos qué quieres instalar y te orientamos personalmente.</p>
  <a class="button button-red" href={`https://wa.me/52${phone}?text=Hola%20SILO,%20quiero%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20una%20instalaci%C3%B3n`}>Hablar por WhatsApp</a>
  <a class="next-step-phone" href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneLabel}</a>
</section>

<style>
  .next-step{background:#fff;color:#090909;text-align:center;padding:125px 20px;border-top:1px solid #ddd;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}
  .eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:800;color:#e61e32;margin:0 0 24px}
  .next-step h2{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto 20px;color:#090909;font-size:clamp(32px,3.25vw,48px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.06em}
  .next-step h2 span{color:#e61e32}
  .next-step>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 30px;color:#090909;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}
  .button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:172px;padding:15px 23px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:999px;box-shadow:0 8px 13px rgba(0,0,0,.16),inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.3);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
  .button-red{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f34a5c 0%,#e61e32 48%,#bd1023 100%);color:#fff}
  .button-red:hover{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f75a69 0%,#e61e32 48%,#bd1023 100%);color:#fff;transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 10px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.2),inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.32)}
  .next-step-phone{display:block;margin-top:22px;color:#090909;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}
  @media(max-width:800px){.next-step{padding:90px 7vw}.next-step h2{font-size:clamp(31px,8.5vw,42px)}}
</style>